  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A ranged monster. msm:ranged_attack names its projectile: msm_examples:ice_shard, a project item with msm:throwable, so the archer throws it as a player would, with the item's own damage, gravity and hit events (an arrow would take damage here instead). The ranged_attack goal walks into range (14 blocks), aims for charge_ticks (the shoot animation plays), throws every 30 ticks and circles its target (strafe), as a skeleton does. base monster makes it an enemy removed in Peaceful; rule monster spawns it in dark taigas.",
